  m_text: 'Ten casualties, one factory yard on fire. Walk to each casualty, point
    and press TRIGGER to select, run the START checks (walk, breathing, airway, respiratory
    rate, perfusion, commands), then assign RED, YELLOW, GREEN or BLACK.


    Tags
    are final. Your time per casualty and every decision is logged for the study.'
